sequenceDiagram
    participant JS as JS thread
    participant CPP as C++ background thread

    JS->>CPP: runJob(input) – enqueue job
    Note left of JS: returns immediately
    JS->>JS: JS continues
    CPP->>CPP: process(input)
    Note right of CPP: runs inference
    CPP-->>JS: push result – event loop picks up
    JS->>JS: outputCallback(result)
